Cell["\<\
Four-stage pest model: eggs (U), larvae (L), nymphs (M), and adults (A). The \
variable H represents the integral of the mortality rate induced by larval \
competition.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97246809936693*^9, 3.9724681670291967`*^9}, {
  3.972468319684821*^9, 3.972468345731439*^9}, {3.972468391139008*^9, 
